# 2-node cluster rig -- ADMISSION run with the op-0x06 MEMBERSHIP builder
# rd vms-f6b / vms-1ee. Image ovmx-genesis-rig:13 on k3s-worker, KVM.
# Every value is read back out of that node's executive (INV-6).

=== OVMX 2-node cluster GENESIS rig (rd vms-f6b) ===
mode=proof
accel=kvm -cpu host group=2026 recnx=8s stagger=30s
node A: OVMXA/1025 VOTES=1 EXPECTED_VOTES=1 VAXCLUSTER=2
node B: OVMXB/1026 VOTES=0          VAXCLUSTER=2

--- powering on node A (it must hear nobody for 8s, then found) ---
--- powering on node B (it must join what A formed) ---

